{"id":867,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>近日，在某J组织的无人航空装备综合飞行比武任务中，中北大学航空宇航学院产学研项目JZ‑550H“玄雕”无人直升机硬核亮剑，在中到大雨的复杂海洋气象条件下，顺利完成海上连续飞行200公里、携带120公斤任务载荷开展作业的高难度科目，刷新海上比武飞行纪录，充分展现了我校在无人航空装备领域的硬核科研实力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=unzVU2LzN4L4viLnR7sMN7DMRLYozQSkLmrRMzL4Lz9ZU8l0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPLShfL1yin7LDM7-bU4QVUNCYMRL8L4lsolC4ozCYMz6FnNM2M4-4ozAFL4NsUlUJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PoRCsgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11867&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/411A25DC64B9C6EBF24343579F396257/FCF72398/397AD\" vheight=\"309.739990234375\" vwidth=\"552.8699951171875\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=unzVU2LzN4L4viLnR7sMN7DMRLYozQSkLmrRMzL4Lz9ZU8l0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPLShfL1yin7LDM7-bU4QVUNCYMRL8L4lsolC4ozCYMz6FnNM2M4-4ozAFL4NsUlUJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PoRCsgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11867&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uLzlU4olVVM46VLnmGsMzTRMlV2U4LS8MRWfMRAfn7UZL8l0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ybnSy4nkyioRv8UzN4nRr2LRLbnRfknN7ZU4AkL47DnzVFM8-aM7-iMlVFL4f7nRCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PoRCsgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11867&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/69E3D5874A93D5F039D0BFA8C8B316E1/7B04B55A/30DD6\" vheight=\"313.260009765625\" vwidth=\"552.27001953125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uLzlU4olVVM46VLnmGsMzTRMlV2U4LS8MRWfMRAfn7UZL8l0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ybnSy4nkyioRv8UzN4nRr2LRLbnRfknN7ZU4AkL47DnzVFM8-aM7-iMlVFL4f7nRCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PoRCsgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11867&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次比武海域风急浪高、云雨交织，面对恶劣的海上作业条件，JZ-550H“玄雕”无人直升机不畏艰难、迎风砺航，以过硬的航空性能与稳定的飞行控制系统，圆满完成全部极限飞行考核，圆满完成高难度飞行考验，成为此次军方无人航空装备飞行比武中唯一完成该项极限任务的无人直升机装备。</p><p><script vurl=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uUlUUYMRQ7L4L4MnllPMNQfnRLanzWS7MmlPMRCiU47ZM8l0gihFp2hmCIa0U1ysU1yiMYhkLzvPUz-sUz7ZozU4nm62Mz7PoRU4MRWVLRTFnllYozCPLRMFLm9YMmQVn1bxvRUeo4Oeq2xZ_ShXptQ0g47aLz70Lz7ZMmvJqdznx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11867&e=.mp4\" vwidth=\"500\" vheight=\"300\" rand=\"null\" vsbhrefname=\"vurl\">showVsbVideo(\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uUlUUYMRQ7L4L4MnllPMNQfnRLanzWS7MmlPMRCiU47ZM8l0gihFp2hmCIa0U1ysU1yiMYhkLzvPUz-sUz7ZozU4nm62Mz7PoRU4MRWVLRTFnllYozCPLRMFLm9YMmQVn1bxvRUeo4Oeq2xZ_ShXptQ0g47aLz70Lz7ZMmvJqdznx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11867&e=.mp4\",\"height=\\\"300\\\"\",\"width=\\\"500\\\"\",\"\",\"float:none;max-width:100%\",\"true\");</script></p><p>海上飞行是检验无人航空装备综合性能的重要标准，在阴雨大风天气下开展长距离海上飞行作业，不仅考验装备的动力性能，更全面检验了设备的极端天气适应能力、飞控系统稳定性、抗风浪保障能力、复杂环境任务执行能力以及长距离持续作业的可靠性。JZ-550H“玄雕”无人直升机全程状态稳定、作业高效，以扎实的实战表现，完成了复杂海况下的综合性能验证。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uMz7UYUznVnlCsUnmUDM8CsUNV2U8lS8Uz-8MllaLN-YMlL0gihFp2hmCIa0USy4MShVL1hVMmW2nznVMllbLNlDLmlsUzGanRVVUzNbMlnFMlrkM8UPozAFLm7YozCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PoRCsgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11867&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A35E2E62FE4E5E92E6257A00D1EA995D/5EB7D198/21296\" vheight=\"308.6700134277344\" vwidth=\"553.1400146484375\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uMz7UYUznVnlCsUnmUDM8CsUNV2U8lS8Uz-8MllaLN-YMlL0gihFp2hmCIa0USy4MShVL1hVMmW2nznVMllbLNlDLmlsUzGanRVVUzNbMlnFMlrkM8UPozAFLm7YozCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PoRCsgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11867&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次优异成绩的取得，是中北大学航空宇航学院深化产学研融合、深耕无人航空领域技术攻关的重要成果。项目成员立足实战需求攻坚克难，持续突破装备核心技术瓶颈，以过硬的科创成果、扎实的实战表现，充分彰显了中北大学服务国防装备建设、深耕航空科创领域的技术实力与使命担当。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=unzVU2LzN4L4viLnR7sMN7DMRLYozQSkLmrRMzL4Lz9ZU8l0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPLShfL1yin7LDM7-bU4QVUNCYMRL8L4lsolC4ozCYMz6FnNM2M4-4ozAFL4NsUlUJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PoRCsgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11867&e=.jpg"}